Subject: [PATCH] Compare distributed FP8 cuBLASLt tactics by algorithm configuration

cuBLASLt can return different bytes in opaque algorithm descriptors for the
same FP8 configuration on different tensor-parallel ranks. Compare the library
version, device capability, operand dtypes and all nine published configuration
attributes during distributed autotuning. Keep rank-local descriptors for
profiling, execution and cache persistence. Preserve candidate ordering and
use exact descriptor agreement if configuration decoding fails.

Base: flashinfer-ai/flashinfer e65caf5cbb90cbc1a6e90ad6aab1c38ff8132291
Series predecessor: 02-pr5943.patch

